{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22401","headline":"自觉二首 二 · 白居易","name":"自觉二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝哭心所爱，暮哭心所亲。\n亲爱零落尽，安用身独存。\n几许平生欢，无限骨肉恩。\n结爲肠间痛，聚作鼻头辛。\n悲来四支缓，泣尽双眸昏。\n所以年四十，心如七十人。\n我闻浮屠教，中有解脱门。\n置心爲止水，视身如浮云。\n斗擞垢秽衣，度脱生死轮。\n胡爲恋此苦，不去犹逡巡。\n回念发弘愿，愿此见在身。\n但受过去报，不结将来因。\n誓以智慧水，永洗烦恼尘。\n不将恩爱子，更种悲忧根。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}